      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "All numeric historical observations use the same nominal private R&D SAAR series and September 30 revised vintage. Original advance-release history could not be fetched: dated ALFRED queries were inaccessible and the BEA archive did not expose usable observations through the web tool. These observations are therefore revised historical estimates, not reconstructed first prints. The registered interactive BEA table was also inaccessible; history comes from the permitted official FRED mirror."
