      {
        "kind": "text",
        "text": "Outside-view base rate: the 14 fetched quarterly levels produce 13 successive increases, with mean quarterly change of 15.226 billion. A persistence-with-drift prior would therefore forecast 950.518 + 15.226 = 965.744 billion before updating for recent momentum."
